Swapify 🛍️
Your Campus Marketplace, Reimagined

Welcome to Swapify, a cross-platform, student-centered marketplace built to simplify buying, selling, and swapping items within college communities. Whether it’s textbooks, gadgets, clothes, or sports gear — Swapify connects students securely and efficiently in a familiar, user-friendly environment.

🌟 Features
✅ Seamless sign-up/sign-in experience with session tracking

📦 Create, browse, and manage listings

🛒 Cart functionality for easy checkout

❤️ Favorite items for quick access

🔍 Real-time search through listings

🖼️ Responsive UI with sliding hero banner and modals

🚀 Purpose
Swapify was created to solve the real-world problem of overpriced textbooks, underused dorm items, and the lack of a centralized student marketplace. With a focus on ease of use, privacy, and speed, it’s tailored specifically for college life.

